{"text": "Something was coming to her, and she was waiting for it fearfully, though she did not yet know what it was. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was too subtle and elusive to name, but she felt it creeping out of the sky toward her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It reached her through the sounds, the scents, and the color that filled the air on that spring day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Now her chest rose and fell rapidly, for she was beginning to recognize the thing that was approaching to take hold of her. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She was trying to beat it back with her will, but her will was as powerless to stop it as her two white, slender hands. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her will giving way at last, she let herself go, and a little whispered word escaped from her slightly parted lips. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said it over and over under her breath, Free, free, free, and the vacant stare and the look of terror left her eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her eyes became keen and bright, her pulse beat fast, and the flowing blood warmed and relaxed every inch of her body.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "o", "m", "e", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "c", "o", "m", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "h", "e", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "w", "a", "i", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "i", "t", " ", "f", "e", "a", "r", "f", "u", "l", "l", "y", ",", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "y", "e", "t", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "t", "o", "o", " ", "s", "u", "b", "t", "l", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "e", "l", "u", "s", "i", "v", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "f",